extra_descriptions.description:
These ears still have blood on them from where they were severed
from the head of the evil elf bunny. Poor thing :(

#{red}#{bold}HAPPY CHRISTMAS 2016!#{o}

These slippers have been lovingly made from the soft, fluffy pink
fur of the evil elf bunny. Awww, you just wanna snuggle them!

#{green}#{bold}HAPPY CHRISTMAS 2016!#{o}

This ring is made of bone from some luckless creature and has been inscribed
in Elven with the words;
#{red bold}
 The flames have died,
 left not a spark! 
 I shall send you all, 
 to the lifeless dark!
#{o}
Whomever forged this rings was clearly crazy.
